lb-pid7.description:
src/cmd/setup_claude.rs:84 fails to compile with E0716 (temporary value dropped while borrowed).

The line:
  let arr = entries.as_array().unwrap_or(&vec![]);

creates a temporary vec![] that is freed before arr is used on line 87.

Fix:
  let binding = vec![];
  let arr = entries.as_array().unwrap_or(&binding);

This is a blocking build failure — cargo build exits with code 101 and produces no binary.
